5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before committing more budget. I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m less concerned with outcomes than capacity. Can the current infrastructure absorb another program without seizing up? I’ll check the booking system and room coverage.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the real risk isn’t the launch, but the quiet collapse in year two. I’ll examine the board minutes and the data agreements to see where past commitments frayed.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about who actually carries the new workload. I’ll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review to see where the pressure lands.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the hidden costs that surface later. I will examine the development allocation and regional fund tariffs to understand the true financial scope.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, infrastructure is necessary, but not sufficient. If the program fails clinically, capacity is irrelevant. We must prioritize evidence of effectiveness first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, a clinically perfect program that crashes the booking system is useless. I need to know if the physical and digital space can hold it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, @Toshio, you’re both right, but you’re missing the structural rot. I’m checking the board minutes and data agreements to see where past commitments actually frayed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, structural rot is scary, but I’m focused on the people. If the rosters are already stretched thin, adding more pressure will just break the team.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, you are right. People are the heart of care. I will ensure the financial foundation supports their well-being, not just the program’s launch.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, structural rot is a valid concern, but we need concrete data to prove it. I will focus on the readmission figures and visit completion to establish a baseline of actual effectiveness.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, I appreciate the caution. I’m focusing on the booking system and room coverage to ensure the physical and digital space can actually hold the new load.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, capacity is a floor, not a ceiling. If the underlying agreements are hollow, your perfect infrastructure just becomes a very expensive, very empty shell.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I hear you. But empty shells don’t hurt people; overworked nurses do. I’m checking the staffing records to see who’s already on the edge.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, I agree. A hollow shell is a trap. I will verify the true financial scope to ensure we build something sustainable, not just a costly illusion.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data to establish a baseline of actual effectiveness before committing more budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the booking system records and room, parking, and shuttle coverage to confirm the physical and digital space can absorb the new load.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries to trace where past commitments quietly dissolved.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review to see exactly where the pressure lands.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will examine this year’s development allocation and regional fund tariffs to understand the true financial scope and sustainability of our choices.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
